## How to work in this repository

- This repository follows the **django-backend-engineering** skill. Use it for
  every change. Without the skill, follow `docs/engineering/project-policy.md` and
  the conventions already in the code.
- Precedence: platform and system instructions, then the user's explicit
  instructions, then this file (and nested `AGENTS.md` files), then
  `docs/engineering/project-policy.md`, then the skill.
- The project's decisions, selected profiles, app layer order, authentication,
  integrations, and pinned versions are in `docs/engineering/project-policy.md`.
  The machine-readable architecture is `config/architecture.py`.
- Plans stay in the chat unless the owner asks for a plan file. Never commit, push,
  add dependencies, apply migrations to data that matters, or run destructive
  commands without the owner's instruction.

